WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:04.720
SCP-682 Vs Dr. Bright. Could&nbsp;
this battle of the immortals&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:08.400
finally result in one of their lives&nbsp;
coming to an end? Let’s find out!

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:14.320
The plan was to get SCP-682 to ingest&nbsp;
Dr. Bright’s SCP-963 medallion,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:18.160
erasing the beast’s consciousness and&nbsp;
replacing it with the good doctor’s.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:22.000
From there, it would hopefully be a little&nbsp;
more cooperative with attempts to kill it.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.160
But it didn’t quite work out like that. Dr.&nbsp;
Bright’s consciousness was at war with the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:31.360
monster’s inside its body after eating the&nbsp;
medallion. On the outside, 682 grew giant&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:36.160
claws and tunneled out of the chamber, where&nbsp;
it ate the feet of one researcher, Dr. Samet.

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:40.560
Thankfully, Dr. Bright was able to escape&nbsp;
with his life and inhabit a new human body.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:44.880
But fragments of his consciousness&nbsp;
were left in 682’s malicious brain.

